    IDS_MSG_22397    "Taking a week off to rest..."
    IDS_MSG_22398    "You're once again fit and ready to continue your adventure."
    IDS_MSG_22399    "You can't afford our training!"
    IDS_MSG_22400    "Sweat. Sweat. "
    IDS_MSG_22401    "The training pays off!"
    IDS_MSG_22402    "You feel the healthy glow of a good workout."
    IDS_MSG_22403    "A feeling of rehabilitation washes through you."
    IDS_MSG_22404    "You can't afford to be healed!"
    IDS_MSG_22405    "Another medical marvel...."
    IDS_MSG_22406    "You can't afford to be cured!"
    IDS_MSG_22407    "Quarantine lifted...."
    IDS_MSG_22408    "A member of the Order of Paladins sent to jail!"
    IDS_MSG_22409    "It cannot be!"
    IDS_MSG_22410    "You are immediately expelled permanently from the Order!"
    IDS_MSG_22411    "Your name is expunged from the records...."
    IDS_MSG_22412    "The destruction of the Order of Paladins has negated the law!"
    IDS_MSG_22413    "Fortunately, there is no jail around here, so you are freed!"
    IDS_MSG_22414    "You are taken to a weirdly deserted chamber where an undead"
    IDS_MSG_22415    "Magistrate presides over a court of ghosts and haunts."
    IDS_MSG_22416    "'Mr. Foreman, what is the verdict?'"
