    IDS_MSG_22418    "'Guilty..."
    IDS_MSG_22419    "Guilty..."
    IDS_MSG_22420    "Guilty...'"
    IDS_MSG_22421    "The members of the court close in around, fingers pointing."
    IDS_MSG_22422    "You feel insubstantial hands closing around your throat...."
    IDS_MSG_22423    "You feel your life draining away!"
    IDS_MSG_22424    "You are finally released, a husk of your former self...."
    IDS_MSG_22425    "Luckily for you, a smooth-tongued advocate from the"
    IDS_MSG_22426    "Rampart Chaotic Liberties Union gets you off!"
    IDS_MSG_22427    "The Magistrate sternly reprimands you."
    IDS_MSG_22428    "As a first-time offender, you are given probation."
    IDS_MSG_22429    "The Magistrate expresses shame for your conduct."
    IDS_MSG_22430    "You are thrown in jail!"
    IDS_MSG_22431    "The Magistrate renders summary judgement."
    IDS_MSG_22432    "You are sentenced to prison!"
    IDS_MSG_22433    "The guards recognize you as a 'three-time-loser'"
    IDS_MSG_22434    "...and beat you up a little to teach you a lesson."
    IDS_MSG_22435    "You see a giant shimmering gate in the form of an omega."
    IDS_MSG_22436    "A familiar female voice says: I would not advise this now...."
    IDS_MSG_22437    "A familiar female voice says: Go for it!"
    IDS_MSG_22438    "Enter the mystic portal? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_22439    "The Lords of Destiny spurn your cowardice...."
    IDS_MSG_22440    "You suddenly feel very inexperienced."
    IDS_MSG_22441    "You pass through the portal."
    IDS_MSG_22442    "Like wow man! Colors! "
    IDS_MSG_22443    "Strange forces try to tear you apart!"
    IDS_MSG_22444    "Some strange force shields you from a chaos vortex!"
    IDS_MSG_22445    "Your head spins for a moment...."
    IDS_MSG_22446    "and clears...."
    IDS_MSG_22447    "The hedge comes alive with a surge of alien growth!"
    IDS_MSG_22448    "Razor-edged vines covered in suckers attach themselves to you."
    IDS_MSG_22449    "Thinking fast, you toss salt water on the trifid..."
    IDS_MSG_22450    "The trifid disintegrates with a frustrated sigh."
    IDS_MSG_22451    "You are entangled in tendrils..."
    IDS_MSG_22452    "Amazing! You're now free."
    IDS_MSG_22453    "The trifid writhes hungrily at you."
    IDS_MSG_22454    "Well, THAT didn't work."
