    IDS_MSG_22456    "A shaft of golden light bathes the alien plant"
    IDS_MSG_22457    "which grudginly lets you go...."
    IDS_MSG_22458    "You receive no divine aid as yet."
    IDS_MSG_22459    "The hedge doesn't answer your entreaties."
