    IDS_MSG_22461    "The hedge enjoys your camp play-acting...."
    IDS_MSG_22462    "You come to a thick vault door with a complex time lock."
    IDS_MSG_22463    "The door is open."
    IDS_MSG_22464    "The door is closed."
    IDS_MSG_22465    "Try to crack it? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_22466    "The lock clicks open!!!"
