    IDS_MSG_22468    """Ah, just testing us, your Grace?  I hope we're up to scratch."""
    IDS_MSG_22469    "You come to a heavily reinforced inner door."
    IDS_MSG_22470    "A sign reads `The House of the Eclipse'"
