    IDS_MSG_22479    "you spend the evening playing German Whist with"
    IDS_MSG_22480    "you spend the evening discussing philosophy with"
    IDS_MSG_22481    "you spend the evening playing chess against"
    IDS_MSG_22482    "you spend the evening telling your adventures to"
    IDS_MSG_22483    "various employees of the House of the Eclipse."
    IDS_MSG_22484    "you spend an enjoyable and educational evening with"
    IDS_MSG_22485    "Skarn the Insatiable, a satyr."
    IDS_MSG_22486    "Dryden the Defanged, an incubus."
    IDS_MSG_22487    "Gorgar the Equipped, a centaur."
    IDS_MSG_22488    "Hieronymus, the mendicant priest of Eros."
    IDS_MSG_22489    "Noreen the Nymph (omaniac)"
    IDS_MSG_22490    "Angelface, a recanted succubus."
    IDS_MSG_22491    "Corporal Sue of the City Guard (moonlighting)."
    IDS_MSG_22492    "Sheena the Queena the Jungle, a wereleopard."
    IDS_MSG_22493    "You arise refreshed the next morning..."
    IDS_MSG_22494    "You arise, tired but happy, the next morning..."
    IDS_MSG_22495    "What are you, some kinda prude?"
    IDS_MSG_22496    "As you fumble at the lock, the door opens...."
    IDS_MSG_22497    "The bouncer tosses you into the street."
    IDS_MSG_22498    "The door appears to be bolted and barred from behind."
    IDS_MSG_22499    "As you charge toward the door it opens...."
    IDS_MSG_22500    "Yaaaaah! Thud!"
    IDS_MSG_22501    "You run past the startled bouncer into a wall."
    IDS_MSG_22502    "Ouch! The door resists your efforts."
    IDS_MSG_22503    "You hear an irritated voice from inside:"
    IDS_MSG_22504    "'Keep it down out there! Some of us are trying to sleep!'"
    IDS_MSG_22505    "You come before a blue crystal dais. You see a broken mirror."
    IDS_MSG_22506    "Look in the mirror? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_22507    "A strange force rips you from your place...."
    IDS_MSG_22508    "You feel drained...."
    IDS_MSG_22509    "You find yourself in a weird flickery maze."
    IDS_MSG_22510    "You come before a blue crystal dais. There is a bell and a mirror."
    IDS_MSG_22511    "Ring the bell [b], look in the mirror [m], or leave [ESCAPE] "
    IDS_MSG_22512    "The ringing note seems to last forever."
    IDS_MSG_22513    "You notice a robed figure in front of you...."
    IDS_MSG_22514    "The oracle doffs her cowl. Her eyes glitter with blue fire!"
    IDS_MSG_22515    "Attack her? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_22516    "The oracle deftly avoids your attack."
    IDS_MSG_22517    "She sneers at you and vanishes."
    IDS_MSG_22518    "She stares at you...and speaks:"
    IDS_MSG_22519    "'The ArchDruid speaks wisdom in his forest shrine.'"
    IDS_MSG_22520    "'Thou mayest find aught of interest in the caves to the South.'"
    IDS_MSG_22521    "'Turn thy attention to the abyssal depths of the city.'"
    IDS_MSG_22522    "'Explorest thou the depths of the Castle of the ArchMage.'"
    IDS_MSG_22523    "'Journey to the Astral Plane and meet the Gods' servants.'"
    IDS_MSG_22524    "The oracle holds out her hand. Do you take it? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_22525    "'Beware: Only the Star Gem can escape the Astral Plane.'"
    IDS_MSG_22526    "A magic portal opens behind the oracle. She leads you"
    IDS_MSG_22527    "through a sequence of special effects that would have"
    IDS_MSG_22528    "IL&M technicians cursing in awe and deposits you in an"
    IDS_MSG_22529    "odd looking room whose walls seem strangely insubstantial."
    IDS_MSG_22530    "You detect the hint of a sneer from the oracle."
    IDS_MSG_22531    "'The infernal maw may yield its secrets to thee now.'"
    IDS_MSG_22532    "'The challenge of adepthood yet awaits thee.'"
    IDS_MSG_22533    "'My lord: Thou hast surpassed my tutelage forever."
    IDS_MSG_22534    "Fare thee well.'"
    IDS_MSG_22535    "The oracle replaces her hood and seems to fade away...."
    IDS_MSG_22536    "You seem to see yourself. Odd...."
    IDS_MSG_22537    "You leave this immanent place."
